# Lex.uz Legal AI Agent (`agent/`)

A production-grade, multilingual, zero-hallucination **Legal Knowledge & Reasoning Agent** covering all legislation of the Republic of Uzbekistan published on [Lex.uz](https://lex.uz) across **Uzbek (Latin & Cyrillic)**, **Russian**, and **English**.

---

## Architecture Overview

```text
User Query (UZ Latin / UZ Cyrillic / RU / EN) or Uploaded Document (PDF/DOCX/TXT)
   │
   ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. Query Decomposer & Language Layer                                    │
│    • Script & language detector (UZ-Latn / UZ-Cyrl / RU / EN)           │
│    • Bidirectional Uzbek Latin <-> Cyrillic transliterator              │
│    • Sub-issue decomposition, branch classification, temporal extraction│
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 2. Hybrid Legal Retrieval Engine (Multi-Hop, 1..N hops)                 │
│    • Dense Vector Store (Qdrant: local disk / memory / remote cluster)  │
│    • Sparse Legal BM25 (SQLite-backed + exact article/act-no boosting)  │
│    • Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) + Cross-Encoder Reranker (BGE-M3)     │
│    • Automatic Cross-Reference Follower (Codes, O'RQ/PF/PQ/VMQ, links)  │
│    • Live Lex.uz Fallback (async HTTPX + optional Playwright)           │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 3. Norm Conflict & Temporal Resolver (per Law O'RQ-682)                 │
│    • Legal force hierarchy (Constitution > Code > Law > Decree > VMQ)   │
│    • lex superior, lex posterior, lex specialis resolution              │
│    • Status & point-in-time checks (In Force / Amended / Repealed)      │
│    • Optional UZ Primary vs. RU/EN Translation Discrepancy Auditor      │
└───────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 4. Grounded Legal Synthesis + Zero-Hallucination Citation Guard         │
│    • Verifies every cited article, act number & Lex.uz URL against pool │
│    • Automatic self-correction pass if unverified references appear     │
│    • Responds in user's exact language with clickable Lex.uz citations  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Folder Structure

```text
agent/
├── pyproject.toml
├── requirements.txt
├── .env.example
├── Dockerfile
├── docker-compose.yml
├── lex_agent/
│   ├── config.py                     # Pydantic Settings (.env configuration)
│   ├── models.py                     # Canonical legal metadata, hierarchy, chunk & API schemas
│   ├── runtime.py                    # Shared dependency container for API & CLI
│   ├── llm/
│   │   └── client.py                 # Async OpenAI/Gemini-compat/Ollama LLM & BGE-M3/OpenAI/hash embedder
│   ├── language/
│   │   ├── transliterator.py         # Full UZ Latin <-> Cyrillic transliterator & UZ/RU/EN detector
│   │   └── comparator.py             # Official Lex.uz legal translator & UZ vs RU/EN discrepancy auditor
│   ├── ingestion/
│   │   ├── lex_fetcher.py            # Live async Lex.uz search/doc scraper (HTTPX + Playwright fallback + cache)
│   │   ├── parser.py                 # Structure-aware hierarchical chunker (Section -> Chapter -> Article -> Clause)
│   │   ├── corpora.py                # Offline HuggingFace loaders (Alii2004/lexuz-legislation, sukhrobnurali/uzbek-legal-corpus)
│   │   └── pipeline.py               # Cross-lingual DocumentRegistry (UZ/RU/EN linking) & dual-index pipeline
│   ├── retrieval/
│   │   ├── bm25_store.py             # SQLite-persisted legal BM25 exact keyword & article-number store
│   │   ├── vector_store.py           # Qdrant dense vector store with metadata & temporal filters
│   │   ├── reranker.py               # Cross-encoder reranker (BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3) with legal fallback
│   │   └── hybrid_retriever.py       # RRF fusion + cross-ref exact lookup + live Lex.uz auto-augmentation
│   ├── reasoning/
│   │   ├── decomposer.py             # Multi-issue legal query decomposition & temporal date extraction
│   │   ├── cross_ref.py              # Multilingual legal cross-reference extractor (UZ/RU/EN + Lex.uz links)
│   │   ├── norm_resolver.py          # Lex superior / lex posterior / repealed status resolver
│   │   ├── citation_guard.py         # Zero-hallucination strict citation verification engine
│   │   └── orchestrator.py           # Multi-hop agentic pipeline + tool calling + self-correction
│   ├── capabilities/
│   │   ├── document_analyzer.py      # Contract, court filing & regulatory compliance auditor (TXT/PDF/DOCX)
│   │   └── temporal_lookup.py        # Point-in-time historical vs. current Uzbekistan legislation comparator
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── app.py                    # Production FastAPI backend
│   │   └── static/index.html         # Built-in Legal AI Web Console
│   └── cli.py                        # Rich Typer CLI (`lex-agent`)
└── tests/
    ├── test_transliterator.py
    ├── test_parser.py
    ├── test_cross_ref_and_resolver.py
    └── test_citation_guard.py
```

